OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA cold morning with widespread
OL,6,Ffrost, severe in places. Isolated
OL,7,Ffreezing fog will be slow to lift
OL,8,Fthrough the morning, but for most it
OL,9,Fwill be a dry day with long sunny
OL,10,Fspells. Feeling cold, despite the
OL,11,Fautumn sunshine.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FDry with clear spells this
OL,14,Fevening, allowing a frost to return
OL,15,Fovernight. However, cloud thickening
OL,16,Fthrough the early hours and patches of
OL,17,Frain arriving from the west before
OL,18,Fdawn.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
FL,169,160,301,260,100,100
