OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FRather cloudy on Sunday. A few
OL,6,Fbright spells, though with showers,
OL,7,Fsome of which may be heavy. Becoming
OL,8,Fbreezy with strong gusts in the
OL,9,Fevening. Feeling chilly and unpleasant.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FCold
OL,12,Fand bright on Monday morning, perhaps
OL,13,Fwith a wintry shower. Rain arriving
OL,14,Flater and turning to snow on hills
OL,15,Fovernight. Showery on Tuesday, then
OL,16,Fbrighter but colder again midweek.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
